; AnaMark TUN v2 - a factory tuning that ships inside Fiblo Galactic.
; Generated by tools/MakeTunings.ps1 - edit that, not this.
;
; 24 equal divisions of the octave: quarter tones.
; Contains 12ed2 exactly, so every ordinary interval survives and the new
; twelve sit halfway between them.
;
; Degree 0 is MIDI key 60 at 261.6255653006 Hz (12-TET middle C),
; which is where the plugin anchors a scale's 1/1.

[Info]
Name=24ed2
Author=Fiblo Galactic
Description=24 equal divisions of the octave - quarter tones

[Scale Begin]
